# Inspiration from Beyond ({2}{U}; Flashback {5}{U}{U}): "Mill three cards, then return an instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to
# your hand." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 from three Moxen: the mill puts Counterspell, Memnite and Lightning Bolt into the graveyard and Bot1
# returns one card, the milled Counterspell (the choice is made after the mill); Memnite is no instant or sorcery and is refused, and
# only one card is returned, so the Bolt stays. On turn 3 the flashback costs all seven of five Moxen and two Islands (the pool is empty after
# paying); it mills three Islands, the spell itself is on the stack and not a choice, and the Bolt is returned. It is exiled afterwards.

